Z||000016||RobertVol||07-07-2000||11:44 PM||||Thanks guys and thanks again for the links. I will post them for your sites. I like the fiero Web ring thing but I like them better on one site so I can just look and pick the one I want. Since may page is still production there are some teething pains. But eventually thats what I want it to be. With the "fiero around the country" link <A HREF="http://ourworld-top.cs.com/NorthFLFieroClub/id29.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://ourworld-top.cs.com/NorthFLFieroClub/id29.htm</A> <P> I want to dedicate each page and some history to the cars so any info you send we can add. it will be kinda of "your" page which can have additions added as you make mods.<P>But thanks for the compliments and Motorhead e mail me and I will let you know were we are and what we are doing here that may help you there....<P>I can tell you that just like anything else it takes time and commitment. I want to make sure we build it up here and stay with it ...and grow. anything to keep our cars alive !! and going !! If we dont follow through it will just sit here as a good idea. But if you get a few  people committed to stay with it it can be a success! It will take more than you by yourself. you will need support.  Just MHO<P>So also everybody else send me more pics and some history on your car and we will get it liste also<P>------------------<BR>Robert<BR>88GT Top 3.8 SC t top <BR>88GT T top 55k for sale<BR> <A HREF="http://ourworld-top.cs.com/NorthFLFieroClub" TARGET=_blank>http://ourworld-top.cs.com/NorthFLFieroClub</A> ||||reg||1
Z||000017||RobertVol||07-08-2000||12:02 AM||||Thanks Guys and I will post your links as soon as I can.<P>Thanks for the compliments<P>Just like everybody else here I feel like this is a great forum and we all have a common purpose "OUR CARS" because of that the link in our club site:<BR> <A HREF="http://ourworld-top.cs.com/NorthFLFieroClub/id29.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://ourworld-top.cs.com/NorthFLFieroClub/id29.htm</A> <P>Is for everybody. I want everyone to know that we have great cars everywhere in the country. So send your cars and some mods that you have done to them. I will add and when you add more mods to your car, send them. I will try to add them to the page dedicated for your car. Even though this site is for our club,  I feel the forum should have a little work in it ! I will try add as many resources as I can. <P>MotorHead e mail me and I can explain what we are doing here to get everything started for our club and if I can help with suggestions I will try. My best piece of advice is dont lose interest! This like anything else takes commitment. If its not followed through  with whoever you get on board to start it,  it will just wind up a good idea. And that it. <P>Finding the person who wil stay committed to it is a start. you know things like Web Pages and gathering info for fiero owners in the area. This stuff takes time. And If you have a active Social life and Work alot can be draining. Believe Me I know!But stay committed and get people together and you can find that person to get the ball rolling. That just MHO<P>    <BR><P>------------------<BR>Robert<BR>88GT Top 3.8 SC t top <BR>88GT T top 55k for sale<BR> <A HREF="http://ourworld-top.cs.com/NorthFLFieroClub" TARGET=_blank>http://ourworld-top.cs.com/NorthFLFieroClub</A> ||||reg||10
